{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_39_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_39","textTraditional":"一、十年，春，王正月，公敗齊師於長勺。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_39_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_39","textTraditional":"不日，疑戰也。疑戰而曰敗，勝內也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_39_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_39","textTraditional":"二、二月，公侵宋。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_39_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_39","textTraditional":"侵時，此其月何也？乃深其怨於齊，又退侵宋以眾其敵，惡之，故謹而月之。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_39_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_39","textTraditional":"三、三月，宋人遷宿。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_39_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_39","textTraditional":"遷，亡辭也。其不地，宿不復見也。遷者，猶未失其國家以往者也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_39_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_39","textTraditional":"四、夏，六月，齊師、宋師次於郎。公敗宋師於乘丘。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_39_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_39","textTraditional":"次，止也，畏我也。不日，疑戰也。疑戰而曰敗，勝內也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_39_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_39","textTraditional":"五、秋，九月，荊敗蔡師於莘，以蔡侯獻舞歸。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_39_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_39","textTraditional":"荊者，楚也。何為謂之荊？狄之也。何為狄之？聖人立，必後至。天子弱，必先叛，故曰荊，狄之也。蔡侯何以名也？絕之也。何為絕之？獲也。中國不言敗，此其言敗何也？中國不言敗，蔡侯見其獲乎？其言敗何也？釋蔡侯之獲也。以歸，猶愈乎執也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_39_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_39","textTraditional":"六、冬，十月，齊師滅譚，譚子奔莒。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}